%% TRIP-043 Leaner departure and aircraft pickers
%% The departure lists and the aircraft step. Steps are labelled with requirement IDs.
flowchart TD
    A[Departure list] -->|R1 Välj on the row| B[Departure chosen]
    A -->|R2 chevron, optional| A2[Details unfolded]
    A2 --> A
    B -->|R3 outbound chosen| C[Return list] -->|Välj| D[Aircraft step, outbound]
    B -->|one way| D
    D -->|R5 Välj on a row| E[Row open with its classes, one row at a time]
    E -->|+ in a class, R6| F[This aircraft holds the travellers, any others lose theirs]
    F -->|R7 not everyone placed| E
    F -->|R7 everyone placed| G[Fortsätt enabled]
    G -->|R8 outbound| H[Outbound folded, return flight shown] --> E
    G -->|last flight| I[Resenärer]
    H -.->|change the outbound, return choices stay| E
